TimelineCurvePalette: on Android the phase colors shift from the tint's own Display P3 components (read back by Color+Android.swift), since a Compose color cannot be resolved; a color without components draws every phase in the base color.

diff --git a/Piru/Views/Journal/TimelineCurvePalette.swift b/Piru/Views/Journal/TimelineCurvePalette.swift
index d8140ab5..f9efe250 100644
